---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../site";
const updated = "October 16, 2026";
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="What KnewCar collects, why, and the choices you have.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>
        KnewCar ("KnewCar", "we", "us") helps people understand new-car manufacturer programs and estimated payments
        before they visit a dealership. This policy explains what information we collect through the KnewCar app and
        website, how we use it, and the choices you have.
      </p>

      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We collect what we need to show you cars and payment estimates that fit your budget.</li>
        <li>We don't run a credit check. Your estimated credit score is saved only on your phone. It is sent to our pricing service only to calculate your estimates, and is never stored or logged there.</li>
        <li>We don't sell your personal information or share it with dealers or lenders without your permission.</li>
        <li>You can delete your account and saved data at any time in the app.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <h3>Information you give us</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account details:</strong> your name, email address, and password (stored by our authentication provider in protected form).</li>
        <li><strong>Shopping preferences:</strong> payment range, down payment, trade-in details and any amount still owed, finance or lease preference, yearly mileage, and ZIP code.</li>
        <li><strong>Saved vehicles:</strong> cars you save and the payment setup shown when you saved them, including whether a pre-approval rate or military status was used.</li>
        <li><strong>Military status:</strong> only if you tell us you are or were in the military, so we can show military offers.</li>
        <li><strong>Purchases:</strong> which KnewCar plan you have and when it started or ends. Payment itself is handled by Apple; we never see your card details.</li>
        <li><strong>Free-preview time:</strong> how much of the free preview your account has used, so the preview works across your devices.</li>
        <li><strong>Waitlist sign-ups:</strong> your email address and, if you choose, your ZIP code.</li>
        <li><strong>Messages:</strong> anything you send when you contact us.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Information we use but don't store</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Credit score estimate:</strong> if you set an estimated credit score, it is saved only in your phone's secure storage. Each time you look up payments it is sent, encrypted, to our pricing service to calculate the estimate, and it is not stored or logged on our servers.</li>
        <li><strong>Pre-approval rate:</strong> if you enter a rate from a lender, it is sent with your payment lookups to calculate estimates and is not stored on our servers.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
      <p>
        Like most online services, our servers receive basic technical information when the app or website connects to
        them, such as IP address, device and browser type, and request logs. We use this to run, secure, and fix the
        service.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide the service: matching vehicles and manufacturer programs to your preferences and ZIP code, and calculating estimates.</li>
        <li>To keep your account, settings, and saved vehicles available when you return.</li>
        <li>To send account emails, such as confirming your email or resetting your password, and beta invitations if you joined the waitlist.</li>
        <li>To keep KnewCar secure and prevent abuse.</li>
        <li>To understand and improve the product.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we share information</h2>
      <p>We share information only with service providers that help us run KnewCar, and only what each one needs to do its job:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Supabase</strong> (hosting, database, and sign-in).</li>
        <li><strong>Expo</strong> (delivering app updates).</li>
        <li><strong>Apple</strong> (App Store purchases and payment) and <strong>RevenueCat</strong> (keeping track of which plan your account has; it receives your KnewCar account ID and your purchase history, not your card details).</li>
        <li>Email delivery services, for account and waitlist emails.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        These providers are contractually required to use your information only to provide their services to us and to
        protect it with the same or equal protection as described in this policy.
      </p>
      <p>
        We may also disclose information if required by law, to protect the rights and safety of our users or others, or
        as part of a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, in which case this policy will continue to apply. We do not
        sell your personal information, and we don't share it with dealers or lenders unless you ask us to.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Update your preferences</strong> at any time in the app.</li>
        <li><strong>Delete your account</strong> in the app at any time (Profile, then Delete account). This permanently removes your account, preferences, saved vehicles, and free-preview record.</li>
        <li><strong>Withdraw your consent</strong> at any time by deleting your account or emailing us. Deleting the app alone doesn't delete your account. Canceling a subscription is done in your Apple ID settings, not by deleting your account.</li>
        <li><strong>Unsubscribe</strong> from waitlist and product emails using the link in any email.</li>
        <li><strong>Ask us</strong> to access, correct, or delete your information by emailing <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under state privacy laws.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data retention and security</h2>
      <p>
        We keep your information while your account is active and delete it when you delete your account, except where
        we need to keep limited records for legal, security, or accounting reasons. Purchase records are also kept by
        Apple and RevenueCat under their own policies; email us if you want RevenueCat's copy deleted too. We use industry-standard safeguards,
        including encryption in transit and access controls, but no system is perfectly secure.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>KnewCar is intended for adults and is not directed to children under 18. We don't knowingly collect information from children.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If we make material changes, we'll update the date above and let you know in the app or by email.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
